WEBVTT

00:00:53.435 --> 00:00:54.103
ONE

00:00:54.144 --> 00:00:54.895
ONE TWO

00:00:54.937 --> 00:00:55.312
ONE TWO THREE

00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:55.813
ONE TWO THREE FOUR

00:00:55.938 --> 00:00:58.732
POISON

00:01:25.634 --> 00:01:27.428
I've completed it.

00:01:34.476 --> 00:01:35.436
Who's there?

00:01:57.708 --> 00:01:59.460
What is this device?!

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:00.711
Master Ma yurt.

00:02:04.715 --> 00:02:06.634
— Is there something wrong?
— Who are you?!

00:02:07.051 --> 00:02:08.052
Master Ma yurt?

00:02:08.218 --> 00:02:11.138
Stay away!
Are you here to apprehend me?!

00:02:19.063 --> 00:02:20.147
Sir?

00:02:23.233 --> 00:02:25.486
Stay away! Stay away!

00:02:35.621 --> 00:02:36.747
Master Ma yurt, what—?!

00:02:36.747 --> 00:02:37.748
Let go of me!

00:02:45.297 --> 00:02:47.257
Abnormal levels of Spiritual Pressure
have been confirmed

00:02:47.299 --> 00:02:49.259
inside Tower Seven of the Department
of Research and Development/!

00:02:49.593 --> 00:02:53.097
Destructive activity has been
defected on the top floor.

00:02:53.555 --> 00:02:55.432
An extremely high density
cloud of Reishi

00:02:55.474 --> 00:02:56.850
is currently spreading
throughout the area'

00:02:57.434 --> 00:02:58.519
I repeat.

00:02:58.602 --> 00:03:01.689
Requesting emergency assistance
from all squad members and the Kido Corps/

00:03:01.772 --> 00:03:03.357
— What the hell?
— I know.

00:03:16.662 --> 00:03:17.705
Retreat!

00:03:17.788 --> 00:03:19.456
What are those things?!

00:03:20.791 --> 00:03:21.792
Move quickly!

00:03:25.796 --> 00:03:27.047
What the—7?!

00:03:31.343 --> 00:03:33.554
Captain Kurotsuchi, please stop!

00:03:33.595 --> 00:03:35.055
Don't come near me!

00:03:35.848 --> 00:03:37.474
What're you going to do to me?!

00:03:40.436 --> 00:03:41.395
Hey.

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:50.487
So you've finally lost it, eh?

00:03:58.537 --> 00:03:59.246
Huh?!

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:23.270
What is this?!

00:04:33.906 --> 00:04:34.948
Damn nuisance.

00:05:07.731 --> 00:05:09.149
What's happening?!

00:05:10.943 --> 00:05:12.402
No!
You mustn't go.

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:16.657
Who's there?!

00:05:33.131 --> 00:05:34.758
We will erase...

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:37.010
your existence!

00:05:52.109 --> 00:05:53.277
The Seireitei...

00:05:55.153 --> 00:05:56.947
Hurry to high ground!

00:06:12.337 --> 00:06:13.380
Serves them right.

00:06:13.672 --> 00:06:15.966
| hope every Soul Reaper dies.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:21.305
All they do is take.
All we do is lose.

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:02.679
What was that just now?

00:07:05.557 --> 00:07:07.267
What's that you're doing?

00:07:07.643 --> 00:07:10.354
Reading the letter Sis left behind.

00:07:10.562 --> 00:07:13.023
It's written in a code,
so I don't know what it means.

00:07:13.899 --> 00:07:14.608
Huh?

00:07:15.484 --> 00:07:18.862
Let me see...
It's just a bunch of gibberish.

00:07:19.905 --> 00:07:21.698
"This drawing is your clue"?
What the heck?

00:07:25.077 --> 00:07:28.205
Don't go trashing her artistic drawing!

00:07:28.664 --> 00:07:29.623
This is stupid.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:32.292
And besides, who's "Sis"?

00:07:32.542 --> 00:07:33.210
Huh?

00:07:33.418 --> 00:07:35.128
Sis is Sis, of course!

00:07:35.379 --> 00:07:36.630
What're you talking about?!

00:07:36.713 --> 00:07:37.714
Did you become senile?!

00:07:38.382 --> 00:07:39.967
You're the one who's senile.

00:07:41.218 --> 00:07:41.885
I'm beat.

00:07:42.344 --> 00:07:43.553
I'm calling it a day.

00:07:43.679 --> 00:07:46.139
Hey. We're not done yet,
you bastard.

00:08:04.199 --> 00:08:04.825
Ichigo!

00:08:07.911 --> 00:08:08.912
Lets go, Ichigo.

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:12.165
Fool!

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:15.585
Idiot!

00:08:18.797 --> 00:08:20.090
<i>I'm not going to thank you!</i>

00:08:25.762 --> 00:08:27.764
You must become a Soul Reaper.

00:08:33.812 --> 00:08:34.771
Rukia...

00:08:36.648 --> 00:08:37.691
Hey, Kon!

00:08:38.316 --> 00:08:39.026
Wake up!

00:08:39.901 --> 00:08:41.361
What is it now?

00:08:46.408 --> 00:08:49.953
This drawing that looks like a cockroach
with a watermelon next to it...

00:08:50.412 --> 00:08:51.621
Could it be a rhinoceros beetle?

00:08:52.247 --> 00:08:53.206
Which means...

00:08:53.832 --> 00:08:57.544
"Returning to the Soul Society
for matters to attend to."

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:03.633
"Will return in a few days, so be good boys
and wait for me, dummies. Rukia."

00:09:06.094 --> 00:09:07.137
Soul Society...

00:09:11.683 --> 00:09:13.727
URAHARA'S SHOP

00:09:14.352 --> 00:09:15.312
Please.

00:09:16.438 --> 00:09:18.148
Oh, thanks, Ururu.

00:09:26.156 --> 00:09:30.077
So...you and...uh...

00:09:30.327 --> 00:09:31.286
Rukia Kuchiki!

00:09:31.328 --> 00:09:32.829
Ah, yes! Rukia Kuchiki.

00:09:34.623 --> 00:09:35.665
And who is that?

00:09:35.707 --> 00:09:36.917
What're you talking about?!

00:09:36.958 --> 00:09:40.087
It's Rukia,
one of your best customers!

00:09:40.504 --> 00:09:43.423
One of my best customers?

00:09:46.051 --> 00:09:48.762
Oh yes, there is such a name here.

00:09:48.887 --> 00:09:49.513
You see?

00:09:49.554 --> 00:09:53.100
But...I'm sorry,
| really don't recall such a person.

00:09:55.185 --> 00:09:56.186
What's going on?

00:09:56.228 --> 00:09:57.604
Beats me.

00:09:57.687 --> 00:10:00.690
But for a second there,
you also forgot about Sis, remember?!

00:10:02.526 --> 00:10:04.194
Did something happen to Rukia?

00:10:04.569 --> 00:10:05.278
Uh...

00:10:05.695 --> 00:10:08.949
| don't know if this has anything
to do with this Rukia person,

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:12.202
but an unbelievable incident happened
last night at the Seireitei.

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.036
Incident?

00:10:13.161 --> 00:10:18.708
Yes. Squad 12 captain Ma yurt Kurotsuchi
lost his mind and destroyed his facility.

00:10:19.042 --> 00:10:23.547
One third of the Seireitei
apparently is in shambles.

00:10:23.713 --> 00:10:24.714
What?!

00:10:24.881 --> 00:10:28.176
If these two occurrences
are connected,

00:10:28.218 --> 00:10:33.390
it could mean that something
is affecting our memories.

00:10:35.684 --> 00:10:39.229
Be that as it may,
what is your relationship with this Rukia?

00:10:39.396 --> 00:10:40.397
She's...

00:10:44.234 --> 00:10:45.569
a close friend!

00:10:46.778 --> 00:10:48.655
She's my beloved Sis!

00:10:48.905 --> 00:10:51.825
Ichigo! Let's go!
To the Soul Society!

00:10:51.908 --> 00:10:52.576
Right.

00:10:52.909 --> 00:10:55.245
Urahara, I need you to open
the Senkaimon.

00:10:56.413 --> 00:10:57.747
| see.

00:11:10.302 --> 00:11:13.763
It appears the abnormal leakage
of Reishi has calmed down.

00:11:14.931 --> 00:11:16.600
Each of the Thirteen Court
Guard Squads

00:11:16.641 --> 00:11:20.604
have begun deploying inside
the grounds to determine the cause.

00:11:39.748 --> 00:11:40.373
Damn!

00:11:45.754 --> 00:11:46.796
Good grief.

00:11:49.841 --> 00:11:52.719
I-Ichigo! It's t-terrible.

00:11:53.345 --> 00:11:56.306
— L-Look at this!
—Yeah.

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:58.308
H-Hey...

00:11:59.476 --> 00:12:00.894
What kind of joke is this?

00:12:01.478 --> 00:12:02.812
It's no joke.

00:12:03.772 --> 00:12:05.398
You think everyone's been wiped out?

00:12:06.024 --> 00:12:08.401
| don't know about
the captains, but...

00:12:08.610 --> 00:12:09.236
Where's Sis?

00:12:09.694 --> 00:12:12.155
Sis is all right, isn't she?
Isn't she?!

00:12:12.322 --> 00:12:13.823
Shut up! Keep quiet.

00:12:14.324 --> 00:12:15.909
Let's find Rukia.

00:12:29.839 --> 00:12:31.508
The gate's closed.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:33.093
They're in our way.

00:12:39.683 --> 00:12:40.350
That's...

00:12:40.642 --> 00:12:41.601
You know him?

00:12:41.893 --> 00:12:43.103
By face.

00:12:44.229 --> 00:12:45.188
Hisagi!

00:12:46.231 --> 00:12:47.524
What the hell happened here?

00:12:48.525 --> 00:12:49.192
Do it.

00:13:08.378 --> 00:13:09.379
What is that?

00:13:10.046 --> 00:13:10.714
It's coming.

00:13:14.884 --> 00:13:15.885
Hyapporankan!

00:13:30.567 --> 00:13:31.234
What the—7?!

00:13:40.744 --> 00:13:41.745
Here it comes!

00:13:42.746 --> 00:13:45.415
Hey! Don't run, you guys!

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:11.608
This is the path
we walk with Rukia.

00:14:11.816 --> 00:14:12.525
Let's go.

00:14:14.569 --> 00:14:16.613
Hey, what was that just now?

00:14:16.905 --> 00:14:17.530
Yeah...

00:14:20.325 --> 00:14:22.118
What's with all these people?

00:14:23.661 --> 00:14:26.122
Huh?! What's going on?!

00:14:26.581 --> 00:14:29.125
That mask... Who are you?!

00:14:29.459 --> 00:14:33.046
I-lchigo, weren't they supposed
to be your friends?!

00:14:34.172 --> 00:14:36.800
Hisagi, it's me!
Ichigo Kurosaki!

00:14:37.509 --> 00:14:38.134
Apprehend him!

00:14:38.176 --> 00:14:38.885
—Yes, sir!
—Yes, sir!

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:41.137
Just a minute!

00:14:51.981 --> 00:14:52.982
You damn intruder!

00:14:57.362 --> 00:14:58.488
Hey, Ichigo!

00:14:58.863 --> 00:15:00.990
| don't know what's going on here,
but doesn't this look bad for us?

00:15:01.366 --> 00:15:04.661
Hisagi, I have no desire
to fight you!

00:15:07.038 --> 00:15:09.416
— Stop!
— Stop!

00:15:16.214 --> 00:15:17.340
Damn intruder!

00:15:18.299 --> 00:15:20.176
Abarai! Don't let him get away!

00:15:20.844 --> 00:15:22.762
Is this all your doing?!

00:15:23.012 --> 00:15:23.680
What?!

00:15:24.347 --> 00:15:26.933
It's me, Ichigo!
Don't you recognize me?!

00:15:27.058 --> 00:15:28.935
What're you talking about?!

00:15:30.645 --> 00:15:31.855
Stop it, Reniji!

00:15:32.856 --> 00:15:34.274
| don't want to fight you!

00:15:34.858 --> 00:15:38.027
Bastard...
How do you know my name?

00:15:40.155 --> 00:15:42.615
Listen to me, Renji!
Rukia's in trouble!

00:15:43.241 --> 00:15:44.367
Rukia?

00:15:44.701 --> 00:15:47.203
What are you babbling on about?

00:15:47.871 --> 00:15:51.207
Don't tell me...
you've forgotten about Rukia as well?

00:15:51.875 --> 00:15:52.876
It's Rukia we're talking about!

00:15:53.084 --> 00:15:54.127
Rukia?

00:16:01.176 --> 00:16:02.719
There's no way
you'd forget about her!

00:16:02.927 --> 00:16:03.887
Come on, Renji!

00:16:05.513 --> 00:16:07.974
Stop talking nonsense!

00:16:08.057 --> 00:16:09.058
Reniji!

00:16:10.268 --> 00:16:11.811
What's going on?!

00:16:11.895 --> 00:16:13.062
That's what I'd like to know!

00:16:15.899 --> 00:16:17.066
Follow Abarai!

00:16:17.275 --> 00:16:17.901
—Yes, sir!
—Yes, sir!

00:16:20.778 --> 00:16:21.988
What're you going to do?

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:23.990
For now, we'll...

00:16:31.915 --> 00:16:32.916
You're...

00:16:34.083 --> 00:16:35.084
You're not getting away!

00:16:35.793 --> 00:16:36.753
Komamura.

00:16:37.879 --> 00:16:38.838
There he is!

00:16:38.963 --> 00:16:39.589
Damn.

00:16:40.256 --> 00:16:41.508
Hang on tight!

00:16:41.591 --> 00:16:42.592
Oh, I will.

00:16:45.637 --> 00:16:46.596
Curse you!

00:16:47.764 --> 00:16:51.184
Bankai! Kokujo Tengen Myo-oh!

00:16:52.477 --> 00:16:55.271
What's this humongous thing?!

00:16:59.984 --> 00:17:00.693
Look out! Here it comes!

00:17:03.821 --> 00:17:06.533
Getsugatensho!

00:17:59.877 --> 00:18:00.920
This place is...

00:18:03.339 --> 00:18:06.676
<i>Gimme back my water!
I'll kill you!</i>

00:18:10.805 --> 00:18:11.431
Quickly!

00:18:15.852 --> 00:18:16.853
Hanging Dog...

00:18:21.232 --> 00:18:22.191
Rukia!

00:18:25.361 --> 00:18:27.113
Hey. What is with you!

00:18:27.739 --> 00:18:28.781
Who are you?!

00:18:36.039 --> 00:18:37.457
Who are you people?

00:18:37.999 --> 00:18:38.625
Sister...

00:18:39.667 --> 00:18:42.545
She won't recognize you unless
she can see your face clearly.

00:18:43.087 --> 00:18:45.715
Yes, I know that.

00:18:50.011 --> 00:18:53.306
Rukia, look...
Look at us.

00:19:01.939 --> 00:19:04.567
Damage report.

00:19:05.234 --> 00:19:10.406
The damage from the Reishi leak covers
200 spirit miles in the east-west direction,

00:19:10.448 --> 00:19:12.992
extending over one-third
of the Seireitei grounds.

00:19:13.951 --> 00:19:15.912
What is the status of
the casualties?

00:19:16.454 --> 00:19:17.997
We've never seen anything like it.

00:19:18.581 --> 00:19:22.585
They were enveloped by Reishi
which turned into petrified stone.

00:19:22.919 --> 00:19:26.589
At present, we can't even confirm
if they're dead or alive.

00:19:27.382 --> 00:19:28.424
What about Kurotsuchi?

00:19:29.258 --> 00:19:32.261
It appears he lacks
a grasp of many things.

00:19:32.887 --> 00:19:35.765
The current situation,
and even things about himself...

00:19:36.474 --> 00:19:39.936
It's as though he's lost
a portion of his memory.

00:19:40.812 --> 00:19:42.438
Captain Komamura.

00:19:42.563 --> 00:19:45.191
| am told you engaged
an unidentified intruder

00:19:45.274 --> 00:19:47.777
wearing a squad uniform
in battle.

00:19:47.985 --> 00:19:48.695
Yes.

00:19:48.986 --> 00:19:51.781
The intruder possessed
a Hollow-like mask,

00:19:51.823 --> 00:19:55.118
and I believe his Spiritual Pressure
is at captain-level.

00:19:55.451 --> 00:19:56.452
Are you sure?

00:19:56.828 --> 00:19:57.787
I'm positive.

00:19:57.829 --> 00:20:02.458
The thing that I don't understand is that
he seems to be very familiar with us.

00:20:03.126 --> 00:20:04.127
Captain Kuchiki...

00:20:04.794 --> 00:20:07.797
In particular, he identified himself
to Lieutenant Abarai

00:20:07.839 --> 00:20:09.465
and appeared to be
speaking to him.

00:20:10.091 --> 00:20:11.300
With regard to that,

00:20:11.342 --> 00:20:16.389
Abarai reports that it was someone
he had never seen before.

00:20:17.932 --> 00:20:19.225
This is most disturbing.

00:20:19.684 --> 00:20:20.727
Regarding what?

00:20:21.018 --> 00:20:23.980
About everything that's happened to us...
myself included.

00:20:25.106 --> 00:20:26.733
There is a crisis at hand!

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:30.737
Consider this the most serious threat
in the history of the Seireitei.

00:20:31.028 --> 00:20:34.657
All squads are to coordinate their efforts
to find and apprehend the intruder!

00:20:50.047 --> 00:20:53.342
I'm so sorry! Forgive me!
Please don't kill me!

00:20:53.676 --> 00:20:54.343
Where am |?

00:20:54.552 --> 00:20:55.762
In an underground sewer passage.

00:20:55.845 --> 00:21:00.433
| was cleaning here when
you suddenly fell from above.

00:21:00.475 --> 00:21:03.519
Your treatment is
as incredible as ever!

00:21:03.853 --> 00:21:04.520
Huh?

00:21:04.645 --> 00:21:07.106
You know about me?

00:21:11.068 --> 00:21:12.779
Come to think of it...

00:21:13.362 --> 00:21:15.448
| seem to recall treating
you before.

00:21:20.077 --> 00:21:23.039
[-I'm sorry.
I'm sure I'm just imagining it.

00:21:25.166 --> 00:21:27.043
Don't get our hopes up like that.

00:21:31.088 --> 00:21:31.714
Let me guess!

00:21:32.423 --> 00:21:34.717
You're troubled right now, aren't you?

00:21:35.593 --> 00:21:37.303
You can tell?

00:21:37.428 --> 00:21:38.471
| can.

00:21:38.679 --> 00:21:44.143
When we treat our patients,
we also touch their souls with our palms

00:21:44.185 --> 00:21:47.230
and feel the pain of their wounds
and the pain in their hearts.

00:21:48.189 --> 00:21:50.566
| guess worrying about things here
won't do any good.

00:21:51.067 --> 00:21:52.068
Are we leaving?

00:21:52.735 --> 00:21:53.402
Yeah.

00:21:53.861 --> 00:21:54.487
Okay!

00:21:56.906 --> 00:21:58.574
Up I go.

00:21:59.742 --> 00:22:02.662
Thanks for your help, Hanataro!

00:22:02.954 --> 00:22:04.163
Oh, don't mention it.

00:22:09.293 --> 00:22:10.753
How did he know my name?

00:22:16.551 --> 00:22:18.928
Here Rukia,
this will make you feel better.

00:22:23.558 --> 00:22:24.183
How is it?

00:22:24.559 --> 00:22:25.184
Good.

00:22:25.977 --> 00:22:27.270
I'm glad!

00:22:29.146 --> 00:22:30.523
Can I ask a question?

00:22:30.940 --> 00:22:31.607
Sure.

00:22:31.983 --> 00:22:33.776
| know the two of you.

00:22:34.151 --> 00:22:37.530
But I'm sorry.
| can't remember clearly.

00:22:39.615 --> 00:22:43.286
DEAR RUKIA, WE'LL BE WAITING AT THE CASTLE RUINS OF
EAST 15. When did I receive this letter from you?

00:22:43.828 --> 00:22:44.787
Pretty good, don't you think?

00:22:44.996 --> 00:22:48.875
| mimicked the style of the drawings
you used to do for us.

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:51.711
| was sure you'd recognize it.

00:22:53.004 --> 00:22:54.797
Why didn't you write your names?

00:22:56.007 --> 00:22:57.049
Because we don't have any.

00:22:57.133 --> 00:22:59.302
What? You have no names?

00:23:02.513 --> 00:23:05.474
But you promised to give us names.

00:23:05.641 --> 00:23:08.311
...promised you?

00:23:08.811 --> 00:23:12.481
Yup. In the World of the Living,
parents give their children names.

00:23:13.024 --> 00:23:16.485
That's why you said
you would give us names, Rukia.

00:23:17.653 --> 00:23:19.322
| would name you...

00:23:19.864 --> 00:23:20.573
Yes!

00:23:29.707 --> 00:23:33.002
<i>For goodness sakes,
what were you doing to get so wet?</i>

00:23:35.171 --> 00:23:37.340
<i>What were you going
to tell us, Rukia?</i>

00:23:37.715 --> 00:23:38.341
What is it?

00:23:38.674 --> 00:23:39.342
Oh, yes.

00:23:40.343 --> 00:23:42.345
You two don't have names, right?

00:23:43.137 --> 00:23:46.098
<i>If you wouldn't mind,
would you let me name you?</i>

00:23:46.515 --> 00:23:48.351
Not having names can be quite...

00:23:50.895 --> 00:23:51.604
What's the matter?

00:23:51.812 --> 00:23:52.939
<i>If you don't want to,
I won't force you.</i>

00:23:53.314 --> 00:23:54.273
I'm so happy!

00:23:55.358 --> 00:23:57.109
<i>I've always wanted you
to give us names.</i>

00:23:57.568 --> 00:23:58.611
Rukia...

00:23:59.737 --> 00:24:00.446
Name us/!

00:24:00.696 --> 00:24:01.364
Please do it!

00:24:01.697 --> 00:24:02.698
— Name us/
— Name us/

00:24:03.074 --> 00:24:04.617
Actually, I've already decided
on names.

00:24:04.742 --> 00:24:05.993
— Yay/
— Yay/

00:24:06.035 --> 00:24:07.703
We're gonna have names!/

00:24:07.745 --> 00:24:10.289
— )/ay_/
— Now, now, don't get so excited.

00:24:10.539 --> 00:24:11.874
— Rukia!I
— Rukia!I

00:24:12.833 --> 00:24:15.378
It's coming to me.

00:24:17.421 --> 00:24:20.549
You were those small siblings!

00:24:23.719 --> 00:24:26.055
What are our names, Rukia?

00:24:26.597 --> 00:24:30.977
What? You mean I didn't
give you your names?

00:24:38.943 --> 00:24:40.820
Rukia! What's wrong?

00:24:41.278 --> 00:24:41.988
Are you all right?!

00:24:43.739 --> 00:24:45.825
Yes, it's nothing.

00:24:46.909 --> 00:24:49.578
Forgive me.
| can't remember clearly.

00:24:50.913 --> 00:24:51.914
I'm sorry.

00:24:53.082 --> 00:24:55.084
What was I doing until now?

00:24:55.876 --> 00:24:56.836
Well...

00:24:56.919 --> 00:24:58.671
You were sleeping, Rukia.

00:25:00.381 --> 00:25:02.341
For a long time.

00:25:02.925 --> 00:25:03.926
Sleeping?

00:25:04.635 --> 00:25:07.763
That's right.
You were hurt and sleeping.

00:25:08.431 --> 00:25:13.519
So take it easy.
We'll always be with you.

00:25:15.646 --> 00:25:16.689
Okay.

00:25:30.953 --> 00:25:33.289
Is something the matter?

00:25:33.664 --> 00:25:34.707
It's nothing.

00:26:15.331 --> 00:26:16.332
That photo!

00:26:16.624 --> 00:26:17.583
It's Sis!

00:26:19.502 --> 00:26:20.920
Keep your voice down.

00:26:21.170 --> 00:26:23.339
Sorry for sneaking in like this.

00:26:24.215 --> 00:26:26.509
| don't want to cause
a commotion here.

00:26:28.344 --> 00:26:29.845
That's a photo of Hisana, isn't it?

00:26:30.679 --> 00:26:31.931
She looks a lot like Rukia.

00:26:33.182 --> 00:26:35.101
Don't you sense something, too?

00:26:35.893 --> 00:26:37.269
What're you talking about?

00:26:37.561 --> 00:26:38.687
Don't play dumb!

00:26:39.355 --> 00:26:41.190
Hisana is Rukia's older sister,
isn't she?

00:26:43.359 --> 00:26:44.360
Rukia...

00:26:45.236 --> 00:26:46.529
That's right. Rukia.

00:26:47.238 --> 00:26:49.198
Rukia is your younger sister-in-law.

00:26:50.407 --> 00:26:53.702
The younger sister you tried to protect
even if it meant breaking the rules.

00:26:58.541 --> 00:27:00.459
So you don't remember either, huh?

00:27:05.422 --> 00:27:06.132
You...

00:27:07.091 --> 00:27:10.386
How do you know about
my wife, Hisana?

00:27:11.095 --> 00:27:12.054
Because...

00:27:14.431 --> 00:27:15.057
Ichigo!

00:27:20.229 --> 00:27:21.230
Stand down.

00:27:21.605 --> 00:27:22.565
Captain!

00:27:24.358 --> 00:27:25.317
Damn you!

00:27:25.442 --> 00:27:26.986
Why are you here?!

00:27:27.695 --> 00:27:28.654
Wait, Renji!

00:27:28.737 --> 00:27:29.822
Shut up!

00:27:30.239 --> 00:27:31.740
Roar, Zabimaru!

00:27:36.579 --> 00:27:39.748
You never were a guy
who listened to reason!

00:27:40.291 --> 00:27:41.333
What?!

00:27:41.792 --> 00:27:44.170
That's why I'm going
to pound it into you!

00:27:51.385 --> 00:27:52.511
Bankai!

00:27:59.268 --> 00:28:00.436
What's the matter, Ren;ji?

00:28:00.561 --> 00:28:01.520
Damn it.

00:28:02.605 --> 00:28:04.440
Aren't you going to release
your Bankai?

00:28:04.815 --> 00:28:06.442
Bankai? Me?!

00:28:07.735 --> 00:28:10.112
You trained so
you could save Rukia!

00:28:10.404 --> 00:28:11.363
Don't know what
you're talking about!

00:28:11.447 --> 00:28:13.532
Roar, Zabimaru!

00:28:18.495 --> 00:28:20.039
Remember, dammit!

00:28:21.999 --> 00:28:25.544
What're you trying to
make me remember?!

00:28:26.670 --> 00:28:29.048
Don't push it!

00:28:40.935 --> 00:28:41.560
Scatter...

00:28:51.487 --> 00:28:57.159
Hisana was born in South Rukon
District 78...in Hanging Dog.

00:28:58.118 --> 00:28:58.744
Thanks.

00:29:14.176 --> 00:29:15.177
Rukia...

00:29:17.513 --> 00:29:19.765
Can I come over?

00:29:20.474 --> 00:29:21.100
Sure.

00:29:25.980 --> 00:29:28.107
Rukia... Is something wrong?

00:29:29.233 --> 00:29:32.611
| feel like I'm breathing the air in this town
for the first time in ages.

00:29:33.362 --> 00:29:38.117
But I feel uneasy,
not knowing anything about myself.

00:29:38.575 --> 00:29:39.535
Rukia...

00:29:41.370 --> 00:29:44.290
The two of you waited
for me all this time.

00:29:45.708 --> 00:29:48.210
Waiting for the names
| said I would give you so long ago...

00:29:53.424 --> 00:29:56.135
| will remember those names,
| promise.

00:29:57.511 --> 00:29:58.137
Yes.

00:30:07.604 --> 00:30:08.647
What is it?

00:30:08.856 --> 00:30:10.482
That.. .hill...

00:30:13.569 --> 00:30:15.654
That's right. It was that hill.

00:30:22.619 --> 00:30:23.579
Rukia...

00:30:33.255 --> 00:30:35.674
What is the matter with me?

00:30:37.426 --> 00:30:40.429
You were never a guy
who listened to reason!

00:30:47.102 --> 00:30:48.103
Zabimaru...

00:30:48.812 --> 00:30:51.440
Why didn't you use your Bankai?

00:30:51.774 --> 00:30:53.359
W-What?

00:30:54.818 --> 00:30:56.612
Stop being intimidated!

00:30:56.737 --> 00:30:59.448
Your soul should know us.

00:30:59.782 --> 00:31:04.703
Have you forgotten the exchange
your soul had with us?

00:31:05.120 --> 00:31:07.373
How pathetic!

00:31:07.831 --> 00:31:09.458
What're you talking about?

00:31:28.018 --> 00:31:30.646
Byakuya... Byakuya...

00:31:36.276 --> 00:31:38.570
Did you go to the Rukon District
again yesterday?

00:31:39.488 --> 00:31:41.323
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:31:41.698 --> 00:31:44.410
It's all right.
I'm not scolding you.

00:31:45.035 --> 00:31:46.745
! was concerned about your health.

00:31:47.538 --> 00:31:50.916
<i>Byakuya. ..
It is something I have to do.</i>

00:31:53.210 --> 00:31:53.919
Hisana!

00:31:55.129 --> 00:31:57.172
<i>I'm all right, Byakuya.</i>

00:31:57.297 --> 00:31:59.675
<i>No, you're not.
You have to take it easy.</i>

00:32:02.010 --> 00:32:05.097
No, I must continue searching.

00:32:06.348 --> 00:32:08.600
<i>No matter what it does to my body.</i>

00:32:11.562 --> 00:32:14.189
Search... For what?

00:32:46.597 --> 00:32:47.973
| have news to report.

00:32:48.515 --> 00:32:50.225
The Hakuto Gate has been breached.

00:32:50.851 --> 00:32:51.810
Is it the same intruder?

00:32:52.227 --> 00:32:56.482
Yes. A team made up of members
from Squad 10 and other volunteers

00:32:56.565 --> 00:32:57.649
are already in pursuit.

00:32:58.108 --> 00:32:58.817
| see...

00:33:00.277 --> 00:33:04.490
But how is it that this intruder is
so familiar with the premises?

00:33:16.251 --> 00:33:17.419
Hey...

00:33:17.461 --> 00:33:18.170
Huh?

00:33:18.462 --> 00:33:21.173
Are you sure this is where Sis lived?

00:33:21.632 --> 00:33:24.092
Yeah. That's what I was told.

00:33:28.639 --> 00:33:29.348
— Huh?
— Huh?

00:33:32.768 --> 00:33:34.937
There's no way Sis would be
in a place like this.

00:33:37.397 --> 00:33:38.023
Hey!

00:33:38.482 --> 00:33:39.107
Yeah.

00:33:39.733 --> 00:33:40.359
It's Rukia.

00:33:40.943 --> 00:33:41.610
Let's go!

00:33:57.334 --> 00:33:58.043
That's right.

00:33:58.502 --> 00:34:01.880
| grew up here with my friends, and...

00:34:03.423 --> 00:34:05.717
Sis!

00:34:07.594 --> 00:34:08.554
Rukia!

00:34:19.022 --> 00:34:20.148
You're all right...

00:34:20.190 --> 00:34:21.567
Sis...

00:34:22.943 --> 00:34:23.902
Who are you?

00:34:24.319 --> 00:34:25.821
What? Sis?

00:34:26.196 --> 00:34:27.656
What're you talking about, Rukia?

00:34:28.156 --> 00:34:28.824
It's me.

00:34:29.324 --> 00:34:29.992
Rukia?

00:34:31.952 --> 00:34:32.911
Soul Reaper!

00:34:32.995 --> 00:34:34.413
What'd you come here for?

00:34:35.163 --> 00:34:36.331
Who are you guys?

00:34:41.211 --> 00:34:41.920
Rukia...

00:34:42.212 --> 00:34:43.255
Stay back.

00:34:46.174 --> 00:34:49.761
Who are you?!
How do you know my name?!

00:34:52.055 --> 00:34:54.850
What about me?
You remember me, don't you?

00:34:55.183 --> 00:34:57.185
Quiet! Funny-looking creature!

00:34:57.477 --> 00:35:00.522
F-Funny-looking creature?

00:35:01.565 --> 00:35:02.274
Rukia...

00:35:04.985 --> 00:35:06.528
You really don't remember me?

00:35:07.571 --> 00:35:08.614
Come on, Rukia.

00:35:09.656 --> 00:35:10.866
It's me, Ichigo!

00:35:15.078 --> 00:35:16.038
You're...

00:35:17.748 --> 00:35:18.373
Rukia!

00:35:18.540 --> 00:35:19.207
Rukia!

00:35:20.876 --> 00:35:21.960
It's that guy's fault!

00:35:22.044 --> 00:35:23.045
Soul Reaper!

00:35:26.757 --> 00:35:27.466
H-Hey!

00:35:28.717 --> 00:35:29.885
What's with you all of a sudden?!

00:35:31.386 --> 00:35:32.387
Stop it!

00:35:32.721 --> 00:35:33.388
Rukia!

00:35:33.597 --> 00:35:36.058
That's right!
Kill that Soul Reaper!

00:35:37.100 --> 00:35:38.393
| said stop!

00:35:41.229 --> 00:35:41.897
What the—7?!

00:35:48.028 --> 00:35:49.988
That wasn't Flash Step.

00:35:50.614 --> 00:35:52.157
What are you guys?

00:35:52.616 --> 00:35:53.992
You're our enemy!

00:36:00.082 --> 00:36:01.416
What was that just now?

00:36:03.210 --> 00:36:04.670
It felt like it passed right
through Zangetsu.

00:36:06.797 --> 00:36:07.422
What?!

00:36:07.464 --> 00:36:08.173
Hey, you!

00:36:10.717 --> 00:36:11.343
Rukia...

00:36:36.326 --> 00:36:37.452
Who's there?

00:36:44.960 --> 00:36:48.130
Now there's someone
| haven't seen in a long time.

00:36:49.589 --> 00:36:52.134
An unpleasant face to see,
as always.

00:36:53.009 --> 00:36:56.722
It would seem you remember me.

00:36:56.972 --> 00:36:58.807
So what's the big deal?

00:36:59.474 --> 00:37:04.646
Surely you didn't come all this way
just to confirm that, did you?

00:37:05.021 --> 00:37:09.985
You're right.
| thought I'd interrogate you a bit.

00:37:10.485 --> 00:37:11.820
And if I refuse?

00:37:13.363 --> 00:37:14.656
You have no option.

00:37:17.951 --> 00:37:20.162
Your memories became confused,
and after that,

00:37:20.203 --> 00:37:23.081
it seems our memories of
"a certain person” disappeared.

00:37:23.665 --> 00:37:25.083
What are you talking about?

00:37:25.667 --> 00:37:28.837
This is what I think happened.

00:37:30.005 --> 00:37:36.011
I'm guessing both you and
that person ran into the same enemy.

00:37:36.970 --> 00:37:37.929
If that was the case...

00:37:41.683 --> 00:37:43.685
Do you recognize this?

00:37:44.519 --> 00:37:47.856
| had the hardest time
finding this in your room.

00:37:48.148 --> 00:37:52.360
Though in your present state,
you probably don't even remember.

00:37:55.071 --> 00:37:56.364
Now then, let us begin

00:37:57.574 --> 00:37:59.701
the process of regaining
what we have all lost.

00:38:03.163 --> 00:38:06.041
No matter how I look at it,
this series of troubling incidents

00:38:06.708 --> 00:38:09.544
has to be the doing of
those strange guys we met earlier!

00:38:10.212 --> 00:38:12.214
And they took Sis away.

00:38:12.672 --> 00:38:16.885
But I can't believe she doesn't
even remember who we are.

00:38:18.386 --> 00:38:22.224
Sure hurts us here in the heart,
doesn't it?

00:38:24.100 --> 00:38:26.228
Say something, man!

00:38:28.230 --> 00:38:29.481
There's nothing I can do.

00:38:30.440 --> 00:38:32.734
They're both the same.
Rukia, Reniji...

00:38:33.443 --> 00:38:35.237
In their minds, I don't exist.

00:38:38.448 --> 00:38:41.993
| held on to the hope that
Rukia alone would be different.

00:38:44.913 --> 00:38:45.580
You little...

00:38:46.414 --> 00:38:48.083
You disappoint me, Ichigo!

00:38:48.458 --> 00:38:49.835
What are you acting
so depressed about?!

00:38:49.960 --> 00:38:51.837
Did you whack your head or something?

00:38:52.379 --> 00:38:55.674
You realized that Sis was in danger
even in the World of the Living.

00:38:56.758 --> 00:39:00.929
Even when everyone forgot about her,
you didn't!

00:39:01.304 --> 00:39:05.433
You and Sis are still connected!

00:39:11.398 --> 00:39:13.859
I'll save her,
even if I have to do it alone!

00:39:14.150 --> 00:39:18.280
| don't care if
she's forgotten about me!

00:39:20.574 --> 00:39:24.035
You can just sit there forever
and think about it like a moron!

00:39:35.088 --> 00:39:36.464
Who was that guy?!

00:39:38.133 --> 00:39:39.301
Are you all right, Rukia?

00:39:40.468 --> 00:39:43.388
| know that guy.

00:39:43.972 --> 00:39:46.892
Yes, I know that Soul Reaper.

00:39:47.934 --> 00:39:50.812
| wasn't asleep
this whole time, was |?

00:39:51.813 --> 00:39:53.064
What was I doing until now?

00:39:53.481 --> 00:39:55.317
Why do I know that Soul Reaper?!

00:39:55.650 --> 00:39:56.818
| don't know.

00:39:56.860 --> 00:39:57.819
Stop it, Rukia.

00:39:57.861 --> 00:39:58.486
You're lying!

00:39:59.988 --> 00:40:01.156
It's the truth!

00:40:04.159 --> 00:40:07.662
After all, we were at
a faraway place, so...

00:40:08.997 --> 00:40:09.998
A faraway place?

00:40:12.667 --> 00:40:14.169
We finally made it back.

00:40:15.337 --> 00:40:16.755
We came back to see you, Rukia.

00:40:17.714 --> 00:40:19.841
It took about a hundred years, though.

00:40:20.717 --> 00:40:22.093
That long?

00:40:22.677 --> 00:40:23.845
Rukia!

00:40:24.512 --> 00:40:27.766
— Rukia!
— Soul Reapers are all alike.

00:40:28.516 --> 00:40:29.935
They exist to only take away!

00:40:30.810 --> 00:40:34.189
That's right. They took everything.

00:40:34.731 --> 00:40:37.525
Happy things, fun things...

00:40:38.485 --> 00:40:39.945
Even you, Rukia!

00:40:40.737 --> 00:40:41.363
But...

00:40:45.742 --> 00:40:47.452
Rukia? What's wrong?

00:40:50.080 --> 00:40:52.207
Rukia! Rukia!

00:40:58.171 --> 00:40:58.797
Rukia.

00:41:00.924 --> 00:41:02.467
It's their fault.

00:41:03.176 --> 00:41:04.135
Sister?

00:41:08.264 --> 00:41:09.641
The Soul Reapers!

00:41:22.278 --> 00:41:23.571
What's that you're doing?

00:41:25.740 --> 00:41:27.242
<i>Hey! Don't look, you fool!</i>

00:41:27.909 --> 00:41:30.412
<i>I didn't look.
Isn't that why I asked?</i>

00:41:31.955 --> 00:41:33.498
It's a surprise for later!

00:41:44.217 --> 00:41:46.261
| was looking all over for that!

00:41:47.262 --> 00:41:51.182
You! When did you steal
that lovely letter from me?!

00:41:51.933 --> 00:41:55.687
Man, she's too good for
a loser like you!

00:41:56.312 --> 00:41:56.938
Kon...

00:41:57.105 --> 00:41:57.772
Huh?

00:41:58.398 --> 00:41:59.357
Sorry about that.

00:41:59.816 --> 00:42:00.942
Huh?

00:42:02.152 --> 00:42:02.944
Man...

00:42:03.486 --> 00:42:05.363
| never thought
you could teach me something.

00:42:06.656 --> 00:42:08.199
| have a lot to learn, I guess.

00:42:08.408 --> 00:42:09.784
What?!

00:42:09.784 --> 00:42:11.703
Hey, don't be so full of yourself!

00:42:12.162 --> 00:42:14.122
So did you pull yourself
together or what?!

00:42:14.622 --> 00:42:15.290
Kon...

00:42:15.498 --> 00:42:16.791
Uh... Y-Yes?

00:42:18.293 --> 00:42:18.960
Thanks.

00:42:19.627 --> 00:42:20.295
Huh?

00:42:21.463 --> 00:42:23.465
W-Well, I'm glad
| got through to you!

00:42:23.923 --> 00:42:26.885
| mean, you also forgot about Sis
when this all started, remember?

00:42:28.094 --> 00:42:32.057
My ties with her are deeper
than yours, after all!

00:42:36.144 --> 00:42:37.812
You can't escape anymore!

00:42:38.188 --> 00:42:40.732
Give yourselves up quietly, intruders!

00:42:45.111 --> 00:42:47.489
That's quite a show of strength, Toshiro.

00:42:49.491 --> 00:42:50.492
What?

00:42:50.867 --> 00:42:54.079
How do you know
Captain Hitsugaya's name?

00:42:54.537 --> 00:42:56.831
Of course I know it!
I'm supposed to!

00:42:57.165 --> 00:42:57.832
Ikkaku.

00:42:59.459 --> 00:43:00.085
Yumichika.

00:43:01.377 --> 00:43:05.507
| wouldn't forget you—
even if you've forgotten me.

00:43:06.216 --> 00:43:08.176
Huh?! What's that mean?

00:43:08.510 --> 00:43:11.429
It's just nonsense, Ikkaku.

00:43:11.888 --> 00:43:14.516
Who the hell are you?

00:43:15.683 --> 00:43:18.520
I'm Substitute Soul Reaper,
Ichigo Kurosaki!

00:43:19.354 --> 00:43:21.356
Substitute Soul Reaper, you say?

00:43:21.523 --> 00:43:24.692
Then show me.. .the proof!

00:43:42.210 --> 00:43:43.211
Bastard...

00:44:04.566 --> 00:44:05.900
Stand back, Madarame.

00:44:06.401 --> 00:44:07.485
I'll handle this.

00:44:12.073 --> 00:44:13.741
It appears the reports were correct.

00:44:14.200 --> 00:44:16.744
You are familiar with
our style of fighting.

00:44:17.620 --> 00:44:21.166
I'll ask you once more.
Who are you?!

00:44:21.457 --> 00:44:24.085
Like I said, I'm Ichigo Kurosaki!

00:44:24.127 --> 00:44:25.753
| don't know you!

00:44:31.593 --> 00:44:34.429
Bakudo 63: Sajosabaku!

00:44:45.148 --> 00:44:45.857
Roar!

00:44:45.982 --> 00:44:47.025
Zabimaru!

00:44:53.823 --> 00:44:54.532
You are...

00:45:06.669 --> 00:45:09.297
What is the meaning of this, Abarai?!

00:45:11.799 --> 00:45:12.800
Get up.

00:45:13.801 --> 00:45:14.802
Reniji...

00:45:16.471 --> 00:45:17.972
Don't get all friendly with me!

00:45:18.598 --> 00:45:21.976
You're the enemy!
An intruder who disrupted the Seireitei!

00:45:22.477 --> 00:45:23.561
You're supposed to be the enemy!

00:45:24.938 --> 00:45:25.897
But...

00:45:26.689 --> 00:45:29.067
| can't think of you as an enemy.

00:45:29.943 --> 00:45:32.987
| know in my head that
you're the enemy,

00:45:33.071 --> 00:45:37.242
but my soul...
is telling me something different!

00:45:38.326 --> 00:45:41.162
That's why I'm following my soul!

00:45:42.789 --> 00:45:43.414
Abarai...

00:45:45.708 --> 00:45:49.170
I'm sorry, Captain Hitsugaya!
Please let us through.

00:46:12.235 --> 00:46:14.279
Treachery will not go unpunished.

00:46:16.864 --> 00:46:18.366
Head Captain...

00:46:22.203 --> 00:46:24.706
The intruder must be captured.

00:46:35.174 --> 00:46:37.051
Please hear me out, Head Captain!

00:46:37.260 --> 00:46:39.304
That's right! We can talk this out!

00:46:41.681 --> 00:46:43.141
You're wasting your breath!

00:46:44.058 --> 00:46:44.726
Apprehend them!

00:47:13.629 --> 00:47:14.672
You?!

00:47:15.256 --> 00:47:16.341
You're...

00:47:19.886 --> 00:47:21.846
Kisuke Urahara?

00:47:22.472 --> 00:47:23.514
Urahara...

00:47:23.890 --> 00:47:26.267
It's been a while, Head Captain.

00:47:34.650 --> 00:47:35.360
Look!

00:47:36.235 --> 00:47:38.613
The Soul Reapers are enveloped.

00:47:39.989 --> 00:47:42.450
What's the matter?
There's nothing to worry about.

00:47:43.117 --> 00:47:44.452
We're invincible.

00:47:46.621 --> 00:47:47.705
Maybe we sheared too much?

00:47:47.914 --> 00:47:48.539
What?

00:47:49.082 --> 00:47:50.708
If things stay this way,

00:47:50.750 --> 00:47:53.211
Rukia might never remember our names.

00:47:54.754 --> 00:47:55.713
Sister!

00:47:55.797 --> 00:47:56.464
No!

00:47:58.299 --> 00:48:00.051
No matter what,
we must make sure that

00:48:00.134 --> 00:48:01.719
she doesn't remember
what happened that day!

00:48:03.137 --> 00:48:05.139
If she does...

00:48:07.475 --> 00:48:09.060
you know what will happen, right?

00:48:12.313 --> 00:48:13.314
It'll work out.

00:48:13.648 --> 00:48:17.652
If we wipe out the Soul Reapers,
Rukia will be with us forever.

00:48:18.861 --> 00:48:21.155
Even if she can't remember our names.

00:48:23.991 --> 00:48:24.659
Let's go.

00:48:27.328 --> 00:48:29.330
How did you get back?

00:48:29.831 --> 00:48:32.333
It wasn't that
| haven't had the means.

00:48:33.209 --> 00:48:35.420
| simply chose not to.

00:48:36.379 --> 00:48:37.755
What have you come here for?

00:48:39.215 --> 00:48:42.510
| see you have a crisis here.

00:48:43.970 --> 00:48:45.596
We have no need for traitors!

00:48:48.558 --> 00:48:50.601
Not so fast, Soi Fon.

00:48:51.310 --> 00:48:52.353
Lady Yoruichi!

00:48:52.979 --> 00:48:56.190
Haven't you all forgotten
something important?

00:48:56.816 --> 00:48:58.776
And what do you suppose
this important thing is?

00:48:59.152 --> 00:49:01.362
Lately, I've been having trouble
sleeping from all this commotion.

00:49:02.697 --> 00:49:04.949
| do hope you could enlighten us.

00:49:05.992 --> 00:49:07.869
What is it that you know?

00:49:08.536 --> 00:49:10.204
The root of all evil.

00:49:10.705 --> 00:49:12.540
The root of all evil?

00:49:13.040 --> 00:49:15.042
Yes, but before I go there...

00:49:15.543 --> 00:49:16.544
Kurosaki.

00:49:17.211 --> 00:49:18.212
As I suspected,

00:49:18.254 --> 00:49:21.549
Kurotsuchi and Rukia's memories were
both sheared by the same enemy.

00:49:22.258 --> 00:49:23.134
The same...?

00:49:23.593 --> 00:49:25.136
You mean the two with
the huge sickle?!

00:49:25.761 --> 00:49:27.388
So you've met them?

00:49:28.264 --> 00:49:30.141
Then you'd better hurry.

00:49:30.933 --> 00:49:34.061
Go after them and
let us take care of things here.

00:49:34.228 --> 00:49:34.896
What?!

00:49:35.605 --> 00:49:37.064
Rukia is in grave danger.

00:49:37.565 --> 00:49:38.232
Got it!

00:49:39.066 --> 00:49:40.067
Let's go, Renji!

00:49:41.569 --> 00:49:44.322
| told you not to act so friendly!

00:49:44.447 --> 00:49:45.156
Stop!

00:49:47.867 --> 00:49:50.077
I'm sure you're all starting
to feel it too.

00:49:50.578 --> 00:49:52.580
An unexplainable feeling that
something wasn't right...

00:49:53.206 --> 00:49:55.500
A feeling that you had
forgotten something.

00:49:56.083 --> 00:49:57.585
A sense of uneasiness...

00:49:59.295 --> 00:50:03.174
That's why even during
a crisis in the Seireitei,

00:50:03.257 --> 00:50:06.427
you came all the way out here
for a mere intruder.

00:50:07.553 --> 00:50:10.097
Isn't that right, Head Captain?

00:50:16.145 --> 00:50:17.188
Tell me something.

00:50:17.647 --> 00:50:18.356
Huh?

00:50:18.397 --> 00:50:20.775
What exactly are you trying to do?

00:50:21.275 --> 00:50:22.944
I'm going to find Rukia!

00:50:23.277 --> 00:50:25.947
So, who is this person?

00:50:26.948 --> 00:50:28.032
She's Rukia!

00:50:28.241 --> 00:50:29.784
You still don't remember?!

00:50:30.493 --> 00:50:34.622
You were the closest to her!
You two go way back!

00:50:35.581 --> 00:50:37.041
...was”?

00:50:38.960 --> 00:50:41.629
— I can't help it because I don't remember.
— Water for sale!

00:50:41.671 --> 00:50:43.047
— Don't say, "You can't help it"!
— Delicious water.

00:50:43.172 --> 00:50:44.298
I'll make it cheap.

00:50:44.757 --> 00:50:46.801
— What's the matter, Renji?
— Would you like some pure water?

00:50:51.597 --> 00:50:54.976
<i>Gimme back my water!
I'll kill you!</i>

00:50:58.104 --> 00:50:58.813
This way!

00:51:14.662 --> 00:51:15.663
Rukia...

00:51:16.038 --> 00:51:17.164
That's right! Rukia!

00:51:17.873 --> 00:51:18.833
Call out her name!

00:51:18.833 --> 00:51:20.001
One, or two hundred times
until you remember!

00:51:25.381 --> 00:51:27.008
| have a question.

00:51:28.634 --> 00:51:32.680
Why are you willing to do
all this to save her.. .this Rukia?

00:51:34.724 --> 00:51:35.850
Rukia...

00:51:36.475 --> 00:51:38.519
She's someone who
changed my world.

00:51:41.022 --> 00:51:45.026
She shared her Soul Reaper powers
with me

00:51:45.026 --> 00:51:47.111
when my family and I were
on the verge of death.

00:51:52.867 --> 00:51:54.118
Thanks to her...

00:51:55.244 --> 00:51:56.454
I'm standing here today!

00:52:03.544 --> 00:52:06.714
What are you saying happened to us?

00:52:07.048 --> 00:52:11.135
Simply put, a portion of
our memory has been erased.

00:52:13.262 --> 00:52:15.306
Let me explain in sequence.

00:52:17.683 --> 00:52:20.895
Shortly after I established the Department
of Research and Development,

00:52:20.936 --> 00:52:23.481
| was conducting a study
of a certain Hollow.

00:52:24.398 --> 00:52:27.902
It lived parasitically on souls and
took over its consciousness.

00:52:28.569 --> 00:52:33.741
When its host became debilitated,
it moved on to another.

00:52:35.534 --> 00:52:39.246
What was particularly unusual
was its ability

00:52:39.288 --> 00:52:43.417
to use its sickle-shaped tentacle
to shear its host's memory.

00:52:45.419 --> 00:52:47.421
Now if this parasite sheared off

00:52:47.463 --> 00:52:51.676
all of Rukia Kuchiki's memories
from her life as a Soul Reaper,

00:52:51.759 --> 00:52:53.177
what do you think might happen?

00:52:53.719 --> 00:52:55.763
No. That's not possible.

00:52:56.263 --> 00:53:02.353
The best it could hope to do was attach
to souls with weak Spirit Energy and

00:53:02.395 --> 00:53:05.106
erase its host's memory
for only a short period of time.

00:53:06.148 --> 00:53:08.609
| don't believe it could
shear away enough memory

00:53:08.651 --> 00:53:10.528
to erase an individual's existence.

00:53:11.112 --> 00:53:11.779
However...

00:53:12.488 --> 00:53:15.866
You're suggesting a separate power
joined with it?

00:53:16.450 --> 00:53:17.451
In all probability...

00:53:17.952 --> 00:53:19.954
Memories are connected
with each other.

00:53:20.413 --> 00:53:22.123
You could call them "bonds."

00:53:22.415 --> 00:53:25.960
In other words, if one person's memories
are completely sheared away,

00:53:26.001 --> 00:53:30.214
at the same time, every past event
related to that individual

00:53:30.297 --> 00:53:33.801
will disappear from the memories
of the people around them.

00:53:34.927 --> 00:53:37.304
This time, however,
there was one exception.

00:53:37.638 --> 00:53:39.557
You mean that Kurosaki fellow?

00:53:40.099 --> 00:53:45.730
Yes. Kurosaki's Soul Reaper powers
originally belonged to Rukia Kuchiki.

00:53:46.105 --> 00:53:49.150
That is why we had forgotten
about him as well.

00:53:49.525 --> 00:53:52.153
A transfer of Soul Reaper powers?

00:53:52.486 --> 00:53:54.655
That is a class one capital offense.

00:53:55.030 --> 00:53:56.490
Yes, that's right.

00:53:57.199 --> 00:54:00.244
However, we owe him
enough of a debt of gratitude

00:54:00.327 --> 00:54:02.663
that we can accept that offense.

00:54:03.164 --> 00:54:05.666
Of all the people we shouldn't forget,
we forgot about him.

00:54:08.502 --> 00:54:12.173
The truth is,
I've forgotten about him too.

00:54:12.548 --> 00:54:17.595
Fortunately, I had kept a log,
so it didn't get out of hand.

00:54:18.137 --> 00:54:21.682
Just a minute.
How do you explain Kurotsuchi?

00:54:22.183 --> 00:54:24.518
We still have memories of him.

00:54:25.019 --> 00:54:28.355
Exactly. That's just what
was puzzling me.

00:54:28.689 --> 00:54:32.860
But, as you are aware,
Kurotsuchi is an odd fellow.

00:54:33.194 --> 00:54:37.448
| wondered if perhaps he did
something to himself?

00:54:37.740 --> 00:54:41.035
With that in mind, I did some checking,
and just as I suspected...

00:54:43.913 --> 00:54:48.375
Kurotsuchi regularly made
backups of his memories.

00:54:53.589 --> 00:54:58.385
Anyway, because of that,
all of you remembered him.

00:54:59.595 --> 00:55:01.055
Let me repeat.

00:55:02.556 --> 00:55:05.559
All memories are connected.

00:55:12.900 --> 00:55:15.069
Well, Kon?
Were you able to tell where Rukia is?

00:55:15.736 --> 00:55:19.406
It's no use.
The Seireitei is too big.

00:55:20.032 --> 00:55:23.744
But I could tell that she passed
through here a short while ago.

00:55:24.119 --> 00:55:27.498
Damn it. What should we do?
We're out of clues.

00:55:27.873 --> 00:55:28.499
Hey!

00:55:28.582 --> 00:55:29.250
Huh?

00:55:29.333 --> 00:55:30.251
Didn't you say that

00:55:30.292 --> 00:55:33.671
you received your Soul Reaper powers
from that Rukia person?

00:55:34.129 --> 00:55:35.339
Yeah. I did.

00:55:35.589 --> 00:55:37.758
Then your spiritual composition
might be similar.

00:55:37.967 --> 00:55:38.592
Huh?

00:55:38.926 --> 00:55:41.428
I'm saying we might be able
to trace her Spirit Ribbon!

00:55:41.595 --> 00:55:43.848
Spirit Ribbon?
Isn't that impossible here?

00:55:44.098 --> 00:55:48.352
Yeah. You're right that visualizing it
here in the Soul Society

00:55:48.394 --> 00:55:50.437
where things are comprised of Reishi
is normally impossible!

00:55:50.980 --> 00:55:53.607
But since you possess
a similar spiritual composition,

00:55:53.649 --> 00:55:56.277
you might be able to trace
Rukia's remnant Spirit Ribbon.

00:55:56.986 --> 00:55:59.113
I'm not very good at
this sort of Kido,

00:55:59.154 --> 00:56:00.781
but I'll help you,
so give it a try!

00:56:01.240 --> 00:56:02.283
There's no harm in trying, right?

00:56:02.449 --> 00:56:05.369
Are you kidding me?!
I'll put every effort into this!

00:56:06.287 --> 00:56:10.124
Rukia and I.. .are connected!

00:56:10.916 --> 00:56:12.710
I'll find out where she is,
no matter what!

00:56:14.795 --> 00:56:15.796
Okay then, let's do it!

00:56:16.964 --> 00:56:17.631
You bet!

00:57:13.020 --> 00:57:13.687
Does it work?

00:57:20.861 --> 00:57:21.528
We did it!

00:57:30.913 --> 00:57:31.538
Wait!

00:57:32.915 --> 00:57:33.958
Rukia!

00:57:36.585 --> 00:57:39.546
I'm so glad you're okay.
Does your head still hurt?

00:57:40.589 --> 00:57:41.882
What is this place?

00:57:43.008 --> 00:57:44.885
This is.. _.uh.._.

00:57:46.053 --> 00:57:47.721
We're going to chase away
the Soul Reapers

00:57:47.763 --> 00:57:49.056
who've been making you suffer!

00:57:50.099 --> 00:57:51.392
Chase away the Soul Reapers?!

00:57:53.894 --> 00:57:56.230
So you two used this device to...

00:57:56.939 --> 00:57:57.564
You mustn't!

00:57:58.023 --> 00:58:01.402
Have you considered how much
destruction this device will cause?

00:58:02.277 --> 00:58:04.405
It might destroy the Seireitei.

00:58:04.446 --> 00:58:05.406
Good!

00:58:05.781 --> 00:58:07.992
Why are you standing up
for the Soul Reapers?!

00:58:08.742 --> 00:58:12.496
The Soul Reapers will come to
take you away from us again!

00:58:13.414 --> 00:58:18.502
...I...don't want to be separated
from you anymore!

00:58:18.544 --> 00:58:19.837
What're you talking about?

00:58:20.546 --> 00:58:22.756
I'll be with both of you forever!

00:58:25.592 --> 00:58:28.178
I'm not lying. Trust me.

00:58:28.429 --> 00:58:29.096
No!

00:58:29.263 --> 00:58:30.347
Absolutely not!

00:58:31.098 --> 00:58:32.182
We have to get rid of them!

00:58:32.933 --> 00:58:33.934
Why is that?

00:58:34.226 --> 00:58:37.104
Because... Because Rukia, you're...

00:58:56.749 --> 00:58:57.791
What's that?

00:59:09.595 --> 00:59:12.306
Don't know what it is,
but it seems to have started!

00:59:12.347 --> 00:59:13.390
Rukia!

00:59:13.515 --> 00:59:14.141
Hey!

00:59:23.484 --> 00:59:24.735
— Leave this one to me!
— Hey!

00:59:24.860 --> 00:59:27.071
Roar! Zabimaru!

00:59:33.702 --> 00:59:34.411
Reniji!

00:59:35.162 --> 00:59:37.331
| said to let me take care of this!

00:59:38.499 --> 00:59:39.666
Bankai!

00:59:54.723 --> 00:59:57.101
Hihio! Zabimaru!

00:59:58.560 --> 01:00:00.354
You...used your Bankai...

01:00:02.731 --> 01:00:04.942
Hey, watch it! You almost got me!

01:00:05.359 --> 01:00:06.777
Shut up already!

01:00:18.163 --> 01:00:19.123
How's that?

01:00:19.206 --> 01:00:21.625
Zabimaru can be used like this too!

01:00:21.834 --> 01:00:22.793
| know!

01:00:22.876 --> 01:00:23.544
Huh?

01:00:23.544 --> 01:00:25.879
Never mind. Go!

01:00:39.351 --> 01:00:40.310
Bankai!

01:00:48.193 --> 01:00:49.820
Tensa Zangetsu!

01:00:55.033 --> 01:00:55.659
Rukia.

01:00:56.201 --> 01:00:57.161
I'm okay.

01:01:03.250 --> 01:01:04.251
What's wrong?!

01:01:04.918 --> 01:01:06.587
| hate Soul Reapers!

01:01:14.803 --> 01:01:16.263
Soul Reapers are...

01:01:20.767 --> 01:01:21.435
What?!

01:01:35.490 --> 01:01:37.618
Rukia, I've come for you!

01:01:37.993 --> 01:01:39.119
Sis.

01:01:39.328 --> 01:01:40.954
That's Rukia?

01:01:47.336 --> 01:01:48.378
Renyi...

01:01:54.468 --> 01:01:55.469
Go back!

01:01:56.136 --> 01:01:57.304
Go back, Soul Reapers!

01:01:57.596 --> 01:01:59.973
Rukia doesn't know you!

01:02:00.265 --> 01:02:01.475
That's not how it goes.

01:02:02.017 --> 01:02:04.144
Rukia is our friend!

01:02:05.312 --> 01:02:07.397
Rukia doesn't want that!

01:02:07.814 --> 01:02:10.484
Rukia is not like you anymore!

01:02:11.443 --> 01:02:13.153
Try to remember, Rukia.

01:02:13.612 --> 01:02:16.657
The Rukia I know wouldn't give up
being a Soul Reaper!

01:02:18.283 --> 01:02:21.662
You put your life at risk to save me,
a person you only just met.

01:02:22.829 --> 01:02:27.334
You shared your powers with me
so that I could protect my family.

01:02:32.547 --> 01:02:34.591
You're that kind of strong person!

01:02:39.179 --> 01:02:39.846
Rukia!

01:02:41.056 --> 01:02:42.182
I...

01:02:42.683 --> 01:02:43.433
No!

01:02:43.892 --> 01:02:46.853
No, Rukia! Don't look that way!

01:02:47.854 --> 01:02:50.190
No! No, Rukia.

01:02:50.691 --> 01:02:52.526
You mustn't go back
to the Soul Reapers.

01:02:54.695 --> 01:02:56.196
Go back to the Soul Reapers...

01:02:58.073 --> 01:03:00.284
So I was a Soul Reaper?

01:03:05.914 --> 01:03:10.961
Soul Reaper.
Tell me your name once more.

01:03:12.379 --> 01:03:14.214
It's Ichigo Kurosaki.

01:03:14.548 --> 01:03:15.549
I'm the great Kon!

01:03:17.676 --> 01:03:18.719
Kurosaki...

01:03:44.619 --> 01:03:45.579
Ichigo...

01:03:49.541 --> 01:03:51.335
No!

01:03:51.418 --> 01:03:52.169
Hey...

01:03:54.087 --> 01:03:54.755
Rukia!

01:03:56.131 --> 01:03:56.757
Don't move!

01:03:57.799 --> 01:03:58.425
You!

01:04:05.474 --> 01:04:07.017
We won't let you have Rukia.

01:04:13.440 --> 01:04:14.775
Sister...

01:04:15.776 --> 01:04:17.277
We'll never let you have her.

01:04:17.819 --> 01:04:19.279
We'd rather...

01:04:21.490 --> 01:04:22.449
What's with her?

01:04:23.909 --> 01:04:26.703
We will become one with Rukia.

01:04:27.162 --> 01:04:31.124
Then Rukia will disappear.
Is that what you want?

01:04:35.796 --> 01:04:36.463
All right.

01:04:39.007 --> 01:04:40.967
We'll be together forever.

01:04:44.638 --> 01:04:45.305
Rukia...

01:04:46.973 --> 01:04:47.641
Rukia...

01:04:49.142 --> 01:04:49.810
— Rukia!
— Rukia!

01:04:54.648 --> 01:04:55.315
Rukia!

01:04:55.524 --> 01:04:56.149
Sis!

01:05:05.200 --> 01:05:05.826
Rukia!

01:05:23.176 --> 01:05:26.179
Disappear... all of you...

01:05:27.806 --> 01:05:29.516
Disappear!

01:05:37.315 --> 01:05:40.193
So this is the root of the evil
that messed up the Seireitei.

01:05:40.569 --> 01:05:41.695
We're going to stop them, Reniji.

01:05:41.903 --> 01:05:44.030
You do something about that woman!

01:05:44.990 --> 01:05:46.950
Isn't that what you came here for?!

01:05:51.746 --> 01:05:52.706
They're yours.

01:06:00.380 --> 01:06:02.215
— Rukia!
— Sis!

01:06:13.768 --> 01:06:14.478
Kon!

01:06:23.403 --> 01:06:24.404
Rukia...

01:06:52.807 --> 01:06:53.850
Evacuate! Now!

01:06:54.267 --> 01:06:57.187
Lieutenant Hisagi,
Lieutenant Matsumoto, look up there!

01:07:10.242 --> 01:07:12.202
What the—?! What is that thing?

01:07:27.634 --> 01:07:28.301
Rukia!

01:07:48.029 --> 01:07:48.822
Shear him away.

01:07:49.281 --> 01:07:50.824
Yes, shear him away.

01:08:06.214 --> 01:08:07.257
Stop!

01:08:20.228 --> 01:08:22.856
Rukia! Please! Snap out of it!

01:08:23.148 --> 01:08:24.524
It's me, Ichigo!

01:08:26.693 --> 01:08:28.361
Try to remember, Rukia!

01:08:43.668 --> 01:08:46.796
It's no use. At this rate,
it'll swallow up the Seireitei!

01:08:47.088 --> 01:08:48.131
Matsumoto!

01:08:49.174 --> 01:08:49.799
Captain!

01:08:50.050 --> 01:08:51.551
Are you okay, Matsumoto?

01:08:51.718 --> 01:08:52.385
Yes.

01:08:58.725 --> 01:08:59.976
What is that thing?

01:09:00.018 --> 01:09:03.813
Not sure, but it looks like
it means business.

01:09:06.775 --> 01:09:08.985
From what Kurotsuchi tells us,

01:09:09.069 --> 01:09:11.571
the enemy should have
the control lock

01:09:11.613 --> 01:09:14.574
for the Reishi convergence device
that he created.

01:09:15.617 --> 01:09:18.995
This terrible state of affairs resulted from
that device functioning out of control.

01:09:19.746 --> 01:09:24.167
At this point, the only way to stop it
is to destroy the device.

01:09:24.793 --> 01:09:28.672
But I don't think that thing's going
to just let us walk in there.

01:09:30.590 --> 01:09:33.259
Kurosaki and the others
are already inside.

01:09:33.426 --> 01:09:37.013
We need to keep the Reishi
from spreading any further.

01:09:37.764 --> 01:09:39.265
He makes it sound so simple.

01:09:39.599 --> 01:09:41.267
He's always been like that.

01:09:47.607 --> 01:09:52.445
All things in the universe
turn to ashes! Ryujinjakka!

01:09:58.243 --> 01:09:59.786
Way to go, Old Man Yama!

01:10:00.286 --> 01:10:04.708
I'm ordering all captains to stop
the wild spread of Reishi!

01:10:04.958 --> 01:10:05.625
—Yes, sir!
—Yes, sir!

01:10:13.508 --> 01:10:15.802
All waves rise now and
become my shield!

01:10:16.469 --> 01:10:18.638
Lightning, strike now
and become my blade!

01:10:20.306 --> 01:10:21.641
Sogyonokotowari!

01:10:23.184 --> 01:10:25.311
Flower wind rage
and flower god roar!

01:10:26.187 --> 01:10:28.398
Heavenly wind rage and
heavenly demon sneer!

01:10:29.774 --> 01:10:31.151
Katenkyokotsu!

01:10:50.837 --> 01:10:51.921
Let's go, Soi Fon!

01:10:52.046 --> 01:10:52.756
Yes, ma'am!

01:10:57.677 --> 01:10:58.344
Shunko!

01:11:22.702 --> 01:11:23.369
Oh no!

01:11:25.038 --> 01:11:25.705
Soi Fon!

01:11:26.206 --> 01:11:26.873
Scream...

01:11:27.165 --> 01:11:28.124
Benihime!

01:11:40.595 --> 01:11:41.721
Lady Yoruichi...

01:11:42.597 --> 01:11:44.891
Forgive me, Lady Yoruichi.

01:11:49.938 --> 01:11:50.730
It's okay. It's okay.

01:11:51.731 --> 01:11:52.398
Let's go.

01:11:52.440 --> 01:11:53.066
Yes, ma'am!

01:11:54.400 --> 01:11:55.401
Follow my lead!

01:11:55.610 --> 01:11:56.319
—Yes, sir!
—Yes, sir!

01:11:59.948 --> 01:12:01.825
Hyorinmaru!

01:12:08.039 --> 01:12:09.666
Growl, Haineko!

01:12:14.212 --> 01:12:15.588
Reap, Kazeshini!

01:12:33.147 --> 01:12:33.857
Yumichika!

01:12:34.148 --> 01:12:35.775
Matsumoto! Hisagi!

01:12:42.574 --> 01:12:44.534
What is this hard thing?

01:12:46.411 --> 01:12:47.787
Hey, this is...

01:13:02.844 --> 01:13:05.305
Captain!

01:13:22.530 --> 01:13:26.326
Are you the bastard who messed
around with my head?!

01:13:28.328 --> 01:13:30.413
Morning, Kenny!

01:13:31.873 --> 01:13:34.000
Hold on, Yachiru!

01:13:34.876 --> 01:13:36.753
Aye-aye, sir!

01:13:57.065 --> 01:14:00.026
Damn it!
If I could just destroy this thing...

01:14:01.361 --> 01:14:02.028
Stop it!

01:14:02.070 --> 01:14:02.779
Rukia!

01:14:12.038 --> 01:14:15.875
That man...
| will shear away his memories.

01:14:17.210 --> 01:14:20.713
Once that's done,
no one will remember Rukia.

01:14:22.048 --> 01:14:26.636
Right. We will be
the only ones dear to Rukia.

01:14:27.387 --> 01:14:31.224
Morons! Memories aren't everything.

01:14:31.849 --> 01:14:34.227
Reniji's soul remembered me!

01:14:34.852 --> 01:14:35.895
Rukia will, too.

01:14:36.938 --> 01:14:40.650
You can't take away our bonds!

01:14:45.071 --> 01:14:45.738
Rukia!

01:14:48.408 --> 01:14:49.075
Damn it!

01:14:54.747 --> 01:14:55.748
Rukia...

01:15:17.812 --> 01:15:18.521
Kisuke!

01:15:18.730 --> 01:15:21.274
It's not going well.
They're too big.

01:15:21.816 --> 01:15:24.694
We're not going to make
any progress

01:15:24.736 --> 01:15:26.946
until we destroy the device
in the lab tower.

01:15:27.280 --> 01:15:30.700
But we can't get to the lab tower
with this in our way.

01:15:31.659 --> 01:15:32.702
What is that?

01:15:34.996 --> 01:15:36.539
Don't fall behind, Yumichika!

01:15:36.581 --> 01:15:38.624
Zaraki? So he's back!

01:15:39.167 --> 01:15:40.460
Now's our chance, everyone.

01:15:40.960 --> 01:15:43.254
It'll be difficult, but we have to avoid
that creature and get to the lab tower!

01:15:43.296 --> 01:15:44.130
Scatter...

01:15:44.797 --> 01:15:46.132
Senbonzakura.

01:15:50.178 --> 01:15:51.387
Kuchiki.

01:15:51.971 --> 01:15:53.890
Nice moves, Byakuya-boy.

01:15:54.682 --> 01:15:55.725
I'm going in ahead.

01:15:56.184 --> 01:15:58.061
We're counting on you,
Captain Kuchiki!

01:16:18.790 --> 01:16:20.666
Daiguren Hyorinmaru!

01:16:24.962 --> 01:16:26.339
Thank you, Captain Hitsugaya!

01:16:26.547 --> 01:16:28.257
Don't mention it. Let's go!

01:16:34.639 --> 01:16:35.848
Ryusenka!

01:16:39.393 --> 01:16:41.437
Well then,
| think I'll get serious as well.

01:16:47.985 --> 01:16:49.529
Kirisaki Benihime!

01:17:05.378 --> 01:17:06.963
Look out behind you, Ichigo!

01:17:10.925 --> 01:17:14.637
Bakudo 61: Rikujokoro!

01:17:30.945 --> 01:17:32.071
Captain!

01:17:32.446 --> 01:17:33.239
Byakuya!

01:17:34.615 --> 01:17:35.825
Who are you?!

01:17:47.461 --> 01:17:48.254
Byakuya?!

01:17:49.255 --> 01:17:52.758
If what you say is true,

01:17:52.800 --> 01:17:55.845
then all the more reason
| must resolve this situation.

01:18:02.101 --> 01:18:03.102
Wait!

01:18:03.644 --> 01:18:05.271
Rukia is still in there!

01:18:06.063 --> 01:18:08.941
No matter what happens,
we're still connected!

01:18:11.235 --> 01:18:14.280
Rukia! Isn't that right, Rukia?!

01:18:23.122 --> 01:18:25.541
Her Spiritual Pressure is turning
into that of a Hollow's!

01:18:26.334 --> 01:18:27.627
It's too late.

01:18:28.294 --> 01:18:29.045
Damn it.

01:18:30.296 --> 01:18:32.131
Sis...

01:18:37.303 --> 01:18:38.137
Kon!

01:18:38.679 --> 01:18:44.644
Please... Please save Sis.

01:18:45.311 --> 01:18:47.396
Please save her.

01:18:50.149 --> 01:18:51.984
<i>Do you want to save your family?</i>

01:18:54.153 --> 01:18:55.154
Of course.

01:18:56.113 --> 01:18:57.323
ls there a way?!

01:18:58.950 --> 01:19:00.576
There is one way.

01:19:01.869 --> 01:19:03.996
You must become a Soul Reaper/

01:19:05.498 --> 01:19:07.250
I don't know if it is possible.

01:19:08.542 --> 01:19:12.255
<i>But if it isn't, the two of us
will both perish.</i>

01:19:20.846 --> 01:19:26.519
She sacrificed herself
to save me and my family.

01:19:27.228 --> 01:19:28.521
She took a chance on me.

01:19:31.148 --> 01:19:34.360
That's why I will never give up.

01:19:38.739 --> 01:19:41.033
Do as you wish.

01:19:56.382 --> 01:19:59.635
Shear him! Kill the Soul Reaper!

01:20:01.554 --> 01:20:02.722
Here it goes, Rukia.

01:20:03.931 --> 01:20:06.559
This time I'm sharing
my powers with you.

01:20:17.445 --> 01:20:19.572
Wake up, Rukia!

01:20:20.740 --> 01:20:21.741
I 77...

01:20:22.950 --> 01:20:25.077
lehigo.. .Kurosaki!

01:20:33.085 --> 01:20:34.170
Rukia...

01:20:35.296 --> 01:20:36.922
What is he doing?!

01:21:18.339 --> 01:21:19.465
Bankai...

01:21:20.174 --> 01:21:22.468
Senbonzakura Kageyoshi!

01:21:29.642 --> 01:21:31.644
Hikotsu Taiho!

01:21:54.125 --> 01:21:56.252
Looks like we managed somehow.

01:22:06.971 --> 01:22:07.763
Ichigo...

01:22:10.641 --> 01:22:11.350
Hey.

01:22:22.903 --> 01:22:23.696
Ichigo...

01:22:24.488 --> 01:22:25.531
Go to them.

01:22:30.202 --> 01:22:31.036
You two!

01:22:32.371 --> 01:22:35.541
Rukia? Is that you, Rukia?

01:22:35.833 --> 01:22:37.126
Yes, it's me.

01:22:38.085 --> 01:22:40.045
We were punished, weren't we?

01:22:41.005 --> 01:22:43.632
Because we didn't listen to you.

01:22:44.508 --> 01:22:48.971
Rukia, please don't hate my sister.

01:22:55.352 --> 01:22:56.812
<i>Help me, Rukia!</i>

01:22:57.229 --> 01:22:57.980
— Where are you?
— Rukia!

01:22:58.230 --> 01:23:00.232
Rukia!I

01:23:05.029 --> 01:23:05.988
Rukia!I

01:23:06.614 --> 01:23:07.656
A Soul Reaper?/

01:23:07.948 --> 01:23:08.908
Stop it!

01:23:16.415 --> 01:23:17.416
You two!

01:23:17.875 --> 01:23:19.001
— Rukia!I
— Rukia!I

01:23:19.460 --> 01:23:20.085
Are you all right?

01:23:20.753 --> 01:23:21.754
Rukia! Behind you!

01:23:29.136 --> 01:23:30.596
That was amazing, Rukia!

01:23:31.305 --> 01:23:32.097
Wait!

01:23:33.599 --> 01:23:34.850
What is that guy?/

01:23:35.434 --> 01:23:38.771
I want...your Spirit Energy.

01:23:39.104 --> 01:23:42.191
<i>This body is useless now.</i>

01:23:42.566 --> 01:23:43.275
Run!

01:23:51.951 --> 01:23:55.621
You're not a Soul Reaper! Monster!

01:24:01.669 --> 01:24:02.711
Rukia!I

01:24:09.802 --> 01:24:12.054
Get away from Rukia,
Soul Reaper/

01:24:14.640 --> 01:24:15.975
You're in my way!

01:24:23.857 --> 01:24:24.900
Sister!

01:24:33.867 --> 01:24:35.244
Yes, I remember now.

01:24:36.203 --> 01:24:41.834
But when I came to,
the two of you were gone,

01:24:41.875 --> 01:24:44.086
and I forgot about it.

01:24:44.962 --> 01:24:49.091
That's because that Hollow
sheared your memory.

01:24:50.050 --> 01:24:56.348
And also because the siblings possessed
a special ability to perform teleportation.

01:24:57.141 --> 01:24:59.518
In all likelihood,
moments before they died,

01:24:59.560 --> 01:25:04.189
they placed that Hollow into
their own bodies in order to protect you.

01:25:05.232 --> 01:25:08.777
After unknowingly becoming
parasitically attached to a dead body,

01:25:08.819 --> 01:25:11.113
the Hollow rushed back
to Hueco Mundo.

01:25:11.989 --> 01:25:15.868
However, the two took over
the Hollow instead.

01:25:16.827 --> 01:25:23.375
And it was their overwhelming desire
to see you again that brought them back.

01:25:25.919 --> 01:25:27.546
Do you remember now?

01:25:28.213 --> 01:25:30.382
I'm sorry we lied to you.

01:25:31.925 --> 01:25:36.221
You see,
our lives ended at that time.

01:25:36.889 --> 01:25:41.310
It hasn't ended.
Death is not an end.

01:25:42.728 --> 01:25:45.731
You came back, didn't you?

01:25:46.690 --> 01:25:50.235
| was happy. I was so happy!

01:25:51.403 --> 01:25:53.405
| wanted to see you again, Rukia.

01:25:54.531 --> 01:25:56.241
You're the only person we had.

01:25:58.786 --> 01:26:00.412
You're not alone.

01:26:01.246 --> 01:26:06.835
You each had the most important person
right next to you the whole time.

01:26:10.964 --> 01:26:13.759
| remembered your names.

01:26:15.761 --> 01:26:17.763
Homura. And Shizuku.

01:26:18.263 --> 01:26:21.183
Together, it means
the two of you shine brightly.

01:26:22.476 --> 01:26:23.519
Homura...

01:26:23.769 --> 01:26:25.020
Shizuku...

01:26:25.771 --> 01:26:26.772
— Yay/
— Yay/

01:26:26.939 --> 01:26:27.606
Names!

01:26:27.606 --> 01:26:28.857
They're nice names.

01:26:30.734 --> 01:26:33.612
That's what we wanted to hear.

01:26:34.613 --> 01:26:35.614
I'm so happy.

01:26:37.449 --> 01:26:38.450
Shizuku.

01:26:38.992 --> 01:26:40.452
Homura.

01:26:42.621 --> 01:26:43.789
Thank you.

01:26:48.001 --> 01:26:50.379
Goodbye, Rukia.

01:26:54.508 --> 01:26:56.635
Homura! Shizuku!

01:26:57.136 --> 01:26:57.970
Don't go!

01:26:58.345 --> 01:26:59.555
No... No!

01:27:00.472 --> 01:27:02.391
Homura! Shizuku!

01:27:03.851 --> 01:27:07.312
Answer me, please!

01:27:39.845 --> 01:27:41.930
DEAR RUKIA, WE'LL BE WAITING AT
THE CASTLE RUINS OF EAST 15.

01:27:41.972 --> 01:27:43.140
Pretty good, don't you think?

01:27:43.182 --> 01:27:47.019
<i>I mimicked the style of the drawings
you used to do for us.</i>

01:27:53.150 --> 01:27:54.860
Ichigo, are you going back?

01:27:55.319 --> 01:27:55.944
Yeah.

01:27:57.237 --> 01:27:59.865
You saved me once again.

01:28:00.699 --> 01:28:03.118
You were the one
who originally saved me.

01:28:06.205 --> 01:28:10.292
You know,
if death isn't really an end,

01:28:10.375 --> 01:28:14.046
then that time we met might
not have been the first.

01:28:15.422 --> 01:28:18.634
We might have been connected
from long before that.

01:28:20.719 --> 01:28:22.137
I'm not really sure,

01:28:22.221 --> 01:28:25.390
but I think maybe once a bond is formed,
it never disappears.

01:28:26.099 --> 01:28:29.228
If that's the case,
even if we forget everything,

01:28:29.269 --> 01:28:31.063
we'll be connected again
somewhere in the future.

01:28:32.773 --> 01:28:35.234
That'll be true for you,
and those siblings as well.

01:28:39.071 --> 01:28:39.738
Yes.

01:28:40.781 --> 01:28:43.909
Well, I'll be heading back,
Soul Reaper.

01:28:44.284 --> 01:28:45.744
Don't call me Soul Reaper.

01:28:46.453 --> 01:28:48.413
I'm Rukia Kuchiki.

01:29:12.855 --> 01:29:25.325
Who is holding you tonight?
Alone in the rain, I cry

01:29:43.802 --> 01:29:50.934
Ashamed at thinking we could
understand each other completely

01:29:51.059 --> 01:29:57.733
I go up to the rooftop with a Dazai book in
my hands and grumble about this world

01:29:57.774 --> 01:30:05.532
When I spat info the sky,
it just fell back on me

01:30:05.574 --> 01:30:12.539
I consider myself a traveler, but I hate
losing my way and making def ours

01:30:12.581 --> 01:30:16.126
Under a roof that protects me
from wind and rain,

01:30:16.168 --> 01:30:19.630
!/ look at the world through Google

01:30:19.671 --> 01:30:26.553
Word's of love that never reach you

01:30:26.803 --> 01:30:33.894
What will the moon shine upon tonight?
A thick cloud blankets the sky

01:30:33.977 --> 01:30:44.988
Who is holding you tonight?
Alone in the rain, I cry

01:30:45.280 --> 01:30:51.995
<i>My unyielding bluff and pride
follows me into my relationships</i>

01:30:52.329 --> 01:30:59.253
<i>Making it hard to even hold on
to the hand that is letting go</i>

01:30:59.294 --> 01:31:06.343
Though I knew I'd never see you again

01:31:06.385 --> 01:31:13.558
<i>If I can't see the moon tonight,
I'll wait for a break in the clouds</i>

01:31:13.600 --> 01:31:24.778
When you look up at the sky tonight,
can you see the moon?

01:31:25.112 --> 01:31:39.209
I want to go out info the wilderness
and see the angelic light

01:31:53.473 --> 01:32:02.316
I get tired of myself and the way I am

01:32:02.357 --> 01:32:09.323
I talk big like everything is stupid,
like I know everything

01:32:09.406 --> 01:32:16.663
!/ hide my incapable self
and conceal the truth

01:32:16.747 --> 01:32:23.879
<i>All it takes to see the invisible is
to close your eyes</i>

01:32:23.920 --> 01:32:36.183
Even if you're not here,
even if we can't see the moon tonight

01:33:07.130 --> 01:33:10.717
Hey! Somebody!

01:33:11.385 --> 01:33:17.057
Why won't anyone come to rescue me?

01:33:20.769 --> 01:33:25.065
Ichigo! You haven't forgotten me,
have you?

01:33:25.607 --> 01:33:32.239
First Sis, and now you? Dammit!

01:33:33.448 --> 01:33:36.576
Sis! Sis!

01:33:37.119 --> 01:33:40.163
Sis!

01:33:40.789 --> 01:33:43.333
Don't forget me!
